    core_self: 'Your sense of who you are and your transformative, depth-seeking instinct create real friction. The Sun wants to express and define a coherent identity; Pluto presses toward transformation and the excavation of whatever the ego prefers not to examine.',
    behavioral_self: 'You regularly encounter the parts of your self-concept that are not as solid as they seemed, and the encounters are neither comfortable nor optional.',
