    core_self: 'Your conscious sense of self and your transformative, depth-seeking instinct pull in opposite directions. The Sun wants to hold a clear and defined identity; Pluto presses toward the excavation and transformation of exactly that.',
    behavioral_self: 'You are regularly asked to transform the very thing you most identify with, and whether that is experienced as growth or threat depends on how much of your identity depends on staying unchanged.',
